# 0.26.4, statics P3: the own pass's walk state (the places, slots, loans
# and views of the function being walked; front/own state, walk, views,
# observe) into front::own::ctx::OwnCx, made by check_program and by
# own_state_at (`query own`), which walks one function afresh. Left out:
# what lives across functions or past the pass (fast, infer, moves,
# summary, diag, drops, kinds: phase 4).
